{
  "_doc": "Default input bindings. Keys use Godot key names (OS.find_keycode_from_string). Rebinds persist in user://settings.cfg. The pad follows the usual layout: A jump, B cancel and back, X interact, Y the salvage roll, RT attack, LT aim and guard, LB/RB the toolbelt, L3 sprint, R3 crouch, Start pause, Back the map, the d-pad the field manual (up), the tether (down), drop (left) and light (right); the right stick looks (Player). Reload, companion orders, building rotation and the log pose have no pad button yet: rebind one in Options.",
